WEBVTT

00:11:28.676 --> 00:11:33.356
our task is to do our best in that spot

00:11:33.356 --> 00:11:35.116
and we will have peace.

00:11:36.156 --> 00:11:41.716
Even the simplest act born from love

00:11:41.716 --> 00:11:44.796
resonates without limit.

00:11:47.996 --> 00:11:49.676
So we're walking.

00:11:51.316 --> 00:11:54.156
And we can arrive into our life

00:11:54.196 --> 00:11:55.476
at every step.

00:11:59.676 --> 00:12:01.716
And we get to ask ourself,